"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Jared Kushner, who is the son-in-law of US President Trump, is going to meet with Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu. This meeting is expected to happen later on Monday.\",            \"english_title\": \"Kushner to Meet Netanyahu\",            \"translated_version\": \"Jared Kushner, que es el yerno del Presidente de EE.UU. Trump, va a reunirse con el Primer Ministro de Israel, Benjamin Netanyahu. Se espera que esta reuni\u00f3n ocurra m\u00e1s tarde el lunes.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Kushner se Re\u00fane con Netanyahu\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Large areas of East and South East Asia have been hit by days of heavy rain. This has caused a lot of problems in the region.\",            \"english_title\": \"Heavy Rain in Asia\",            \"translated_version\": \"Grandes \u00e1reas del Este y Sudeste de Asia han sido afectadas por d\u00edas de lluvia fuerte. Esto ha causado muchos problemas en la regi\u00f3n.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Lluvia Fuerte en Asia\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"In Moscow, there were deadly strikes against Ukraine overnight. These strikes caused fires across the capital city, Kyiv.\",            \"english_title\": \"Strikes in Moscow\",            \"translated_version\": \"En Mosc\u00fa, hubo ataques mortales contra Ucrania durante la noche. Estos ataques causaron incendios en toda la ciudad capital, Kyiv.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataques en Mosc\u00fa\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"About 200 firefighters worked hard to stop fires from reaching the town of Salamina. They managed to get one of the fires under control.\",            \"english_title\": \"Firefighters in Salamina\",            \"translated_version\": \"Unos 200 bomberos trabajaron duro para evitar que los incendios llegaran al pueblo de Salamina. Lograron controlar uno de los incendios.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Bomberos en Salamina\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A tourist bus overturned early on Sunday morning. This accident left dozens of people seriously injured.\",            \"english_title\": \"Bus Accident\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un autob\u00fas tur\u00edstico volc\u00f3 temprano el domingo por la ma\u00f1ana. Este accidente dej\u00f3 a docenas de personas gravemente heridas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Accidente de Autob\u00fas\"        }    ]}"